~ mark_talk
[Mark]: Yo, Riley, could you give me a hand?
[Riley]: Sure, what’s up?
[Mark]: My crew is passing through the town later, but there are too many extra boxes blocking the passageway.
[Riley]: You put them there!
[Riley]: Okay, so let me guess.
[Riley]: You want me to move the boxes somewhere else?
[Mark]: Actually, we don’t really need the boxes anymore.
[Mark]: Can we just, like, destroy them?
[Riley]: Isn’t this like a big waste of resources?
[Mark]: We live next to a forest; it’s fine.
[Riley]: If you say so... I'll get it taken care of tomorrow.
[Mark]: Here, take my axe so you can dismantle them better!
[Riley]: WHY DO YOU JUST HAVE AN AXE???
[Mark]: Talk to you later!
=> END